`createWorkspaceState` must create idle statuses for every operation and an empty note list. `reduceWorkspace` must be immutable: it must not modify the supplied state, event, or event notes. `Begin`, `Succeed`, and `Fail` update only the named operation. `ReplaceNotes` replaces notes with fresh note objects. `RemoveNote` removes only the note whose board ID and note ID both match; similarly named notes on other boards remain. Removing a missing note leaves equivalent content and still returns a fresh notes array. Note order is preserved.

